    "detailed_description": "<h1>Collector's Edition</h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Contains 12 more chapters </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 CE-exclusive Hidden Object scenes!</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to the Great Lakes of the USA! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore stunning destinations such as St. Cloud, Niagara Falls, Chicago, Cleveland, Milkwaukee, and many more! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517910/extras/a365d34390890b1550e2dc3ec49e1eaa.poster.avif?t=1729159999\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517910/extras/a365d34390890b1550e2dc3ec49e1eaa.webm?t=1729159999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517910/extras/a365d34390890b1550e2dc3ec49e1eaa.mp4?t=1729159999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Along your journey, you'll encounter fascinating trivia about the iconic locations, play fun mini-games, and see the beauty of the locations surrounding the Great Lakes. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517910/extras/0a42ebceb32947817a83ad132c4a3c19.poster.avif?t=1729159999\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517910/extras/0a42ebceb32947817a83ad132c4a3c19.webm?t=1729159999\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2517910/extras/0a42ebceb32947817a83ad132c4a3c19.mp4?t=1729159999\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy one stunning chapter after another and experience all that the Great Lakes has in store in this all-American Hidden Object game!</p>",
